# Names only. Never commit real values.
# None of these are required for `yyds run` on a local brief.
#
# OPENAI_BASE_URL + OPENAI_API_KEY: optional during expand. May replace tagline and home intro.
# OPENAI_MODEL: optional. If unset, the encoded default gpt-4o-mini is recorded.
# INDEXNOW_KEY, GSC_ACCESS_TOKEN, BAIDU_PUSH_TOKEN: used only when a complete brief
# sets index.live_submit true (and the site is not an unreviewed YMYL hold).
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN + CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID: used only when mode is production and cloudflare.enabled is true.
# GSC_ACCESS_TOKEN is also the live observe token when observe.mode is live.
# Non-public contact fields name an env var (for example SITE_PHONE) but the site never prints that value.

OPENAI_BASE_URL=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=
INDEXNOW_KEY=
GSC_ACCESS_TOKEN=
BAIDU_PUSH_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=
SITE_PHONE=
